# Styleguide CSS Requirements

## Critical Rule
**ALWAYS use styleguide functions and mixins instead of hardcoded values**

The styleguide system provides centralized design tokens for colors, spacing, typography, and more. Never hardcode these values directly in component styles.

## Import Pattern

Always import the styleguide system at the top of SCSS files:

```scss
@use '../../styles/styleguide' as sg;
@use '../../styles/core/unit' as u;
```

**Note:** Adjust the relative path (`../../`) based on your file location relative to `src/styles/`.

## Colors

**NEVER hardcode colors. ALWAYS use `sg.color()` function:**

```scss
// ✅ Good - Using styleguide color function
.my-component {
  background-color: sg.color(black);
  color: sg.color(white);
  border-color: sg.color(black-10);
}

// ❌ Bad - Hardcoded colors
.my-component {
  background-color: #000000;
  color: #ffffff;
  border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
}
```

### Available Color Keys
- `black`, `white`, `orange`
- `black-80`, `black-50`, `black-20`, `black-10`
- `white-80`, `white-50`, `white-20`, `white-10`
- `background`, `carrara`
- `border-dark`, `border-light`
- `success`, `success-20`
- `error`, `error-20`
- `transparent`

## Spacing

**NEVER hardcode spacing values. ALWAYS use `sg.spacing()` function:**

```scss
// ✅ Good - Using styleguide spacing function
.my-component {
  padding: sg.spacing(large);
  margin: sg.spacing(small);
  gap: sg.spacing(regular);
}

// ❌ Bad - Hardcoded spacing
.my-component {
  padding: 32px;
  margin: 12px;
  gap: 16px;
}
```

### Available Spacing Keys
- `xxxxlarge` (120px)
- `xxxlarge` (80px)
- `xxlarge` (64px)
- `xlarge` (40px)
- `large` (32px)
- `medium` (24px)
- `regular` (16px)
- `small` (12px)
- `xsmall` (8px)
- `xxsmall` (4px)

## Typography

**NEVER hardcode typography values. ALWAYS use styleguide typography functions:**

```scss
// ✅ Good - Using styleguide typography functions
.my-component {
  font-family: sg.font-family(barlow);
  font-size: sg.font-size(regular);
  font-weight: sg.font-weight(medium);
  font-style: sg.font-style(italic);
  line-height: sg.line-height('120%');
  letter-spacing: sg.letter-spacing('5%');
}

// ❌ Bad - Hardcoded typography
.my-component {
  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.2;
}
```

### Typography Functions

**Font Families:**
- `sg.font-family(anton)`
- `sg.font-family(barlow)`
- `sg.font-family(barlow-semi-condensed)`

**Font Sizes:**
- `sg.font-size(xxxlarge)` - 80px
- `sg.font-size(xxlarge)` - 64px
- `sg.font-size(xlarge)` - 40px
- `sg.font-size(large)` - 32px
- `sg.font-size(medium)` - 24px
- `sg.font-size(regular)` - 16px
- `sg.font-size(small)` - 14px
- `sg.font-size(xsmall)` - 12px
- `sg.font-size(xxsmall)` - 10px

**Font Weights:**
- `sg.font-weight(light)` - 200
- `sg.font-weight(regular)` - 400
- `sg.font-weight(medium)` - 500
- `sg.font-weight(semibold)` - 600
- `sg.font-weight(bold)` - 700
- `sg.font-weight(extrabold)` - 800
- Or use numeric: `sg.font-weight(400)`, `sg.font-weight(700)`, etc.

**Line Heights:**
- `sg.line-height('100%')` - 1.0
- `sg.line-height('110%')` - 1.1
- `sg.line-height('120%')` - 1.2
- `sg.line-height('130%')` - 1.3
- `sg.line-height('140%')` - 1.4

**Letter Spacing:**
- `sg.letter-spacing('1%')` - 0.01em
- `sg.letter-spacing('2%')` - 0.02em
- `sg.letter-spacing('5%')` - 0.05em

## Units

**Use `u.rem-calc()` for pixel-to-rem conversion:**

```scss
// ✅ Good - Using unit conversion function
.my-component {
  width: u.rem-calc(300);
  height: u.rem-calc(200);
  border-radius: u.rem-calc(10);
}

// ❌ Bad - Hardcoded rem values or pixels
.my-component {
  width: 18.75rem;
  height: 12.5rem;
  border-radius: 0.625rem;
}
```

## Mixins

### Transitions

```scss
// ✅ Good - Using styleguide transition mixin
.my-component {
  @include sg.transition(transform, 200, 'easeOutQuart');
  @include sg.transition(opacity, 300);
}

// ❌ Bad - Hardcoded transitions
.my-component {
  transition: transform 200ms ease-out;
  transition: opacity 300ms;
}
```

### Hover States

```scss
// ✅ Good - Using hover-state mixin
.my-component {
  @include sg.hover-state {
    background-color: sg.color(orange);
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }
}

// With focus support
.my-component {
  @include sg.hover-state($focus: true) {
    outline: 2px solid sg.color(orange);
  }
}
```

### Container

```scss
// ✅ Good - Using container mixin
.my-section {
  @include sg.container(); // Default max-width: 1512px
  @include sg.container(1200); // Custom max-width
}
```

### Section Padding

```scss
// ✅ Good - Using section-padding mixin
.my-section {
  @include sg.section-padding();
}
```

## Button Styles

Use styleguide button mixins for consistent button styling:

```scss
// ✅ Good - Using button mixins
.my-button {
  @include sg.button($animated: true);
  @include sg.button-size(medium);
  @include sg.button-color(orange);
  @include sg.button-animation-color(orange);
}

// Underline button
.my-link {
  @include sg.underline($animated: true);
  @include sg.underline-color(black);
}

// Pill button
.my-pill {
  @include sg.pill(small, black);
  @include sg.pill-size(small);
  @include sg.pill-color(black);
}
```

## Media Queries

Use styleguide media query mixins:

```scss
// ✅ Good - Using media query mixins
.my-component {
  font-size: sg.font-size(small);

  @include sg.min(laptopSmall) {
    font-size: sg.font-size(regular);
  }

  @include sg.max(tablet) {
    padding: sg.spacing(small);
  }
}
```

## File Naming

- **Component styles**: Use `.module.scss` extension (e.g., `style.module.scss`)
- **Global styles**: Use `.scss` extension (e.g., `main.scss`)
- **Styleguide files**: Located in `src/styles/styleguide/` with `_` prefix (e.g., `_color.scss`)

## BEM Naming Convention

Use BEM (Block Element Modifier) naming for CSS classes:

```scss
// ✅ Good - BEM naming
.my-component {
  &__header {
    // Element
  }

  &--active {
    // Modifier
  }

  &__item {
    &--highlighted {
      // Nested modifier
    }
  }
}
```

## Examples

### Complete Component Example

```scss
@use '../../styles/styleguide' as sg;
@use '../../styles/core/unit' as u;

.card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: sg.spacing(regular);
  padding: sg.spacing(large);
  background-color: sg.color(white);
  border: 1px solid sg.color(black-10);
  border-radius: u.rem-calc(10);

  &__header {
    font-family: sg.font-family(barlow);
    font-size: sg.font-size(large);
    font-weight: sg.font-weight(bold);
    color: sg.color(black);
  }

  &__content {
    font-size: sg.font-size(regular);
    line-height: sg.line-height('120%');
    color: sg.color(black-50);
  }

  &__button {
    @include sg.button();
    @include sg.button-size(medium);
    @include sg.button-color(orange);

    @include sg.hover-state {
      transform: translateY(u.rem-calc(-2));
    }
  }

  &--featured {
    background-color: sg.color(orange);
    border-color: sg.color(orange);
  }

  @include sg.min(laptopSmall) {
    padding: sg.spacing(xlarge);
  }
}
```

### Styleguide Page Example

```scss
@use '../../styles/styleguide' as sg;
@use '../../styles/core/unit' as u;

.colors {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: sg.spacing(large);

  &__example {
    display: block;
    width: u.rem-calc(40);
    height: u.rem-calc(40);
    border: 1px solid sg.color(black-10);

    &--black {
      background-color: sg.color(black);
    }

    &--orange {
      background-color: sg.color(orange);
    }
  }
}
```

## Common Mistakes to Avoid

### ❌ Don't Hardcode Values
```scss
// Bad
.component {
  padding: 20px;
  color: #000;
  font-size: 18px;
}
```

### ❌ Don't Use Direct Color Values
```scss
// Bad
.component {
  background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  color: #ffffff;
}
```

### ❌ Don't Skip Unit Conversion
```scss
// Bad
.component {
  width: 300px;
  margin: 16px;
}
```

### ✅ Always Use Styleguide Functions
```scss
// Good
.component {
  padding: sg.spacing(medium);
  color: sg.color(black);
  font-size: sg.font-size(regular);
  width: u.rem-calc(300);
  margin: sg.spacing(regular);
}
```

